    {
      "displayText": "Gooomaaa!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047006F006F006F006D00610061006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hey, kid!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650079002C0020006B00690064002100100002011400040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mind if I ask you a few questions?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0069006E006400200069006600200049002000610073006B00200079006F00750020006100200066006500770020007100750065007300740069006F006E0073003F00100002011400040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Is that your Pokémon there?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900730020007400680061007400200079006F0075007200200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002000740068006500720065003F001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It sure isn’t, ma’am",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049007400200073007500720065002000690073006E20190074002C0020006D006120190061006D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Never seen it before",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E00650076006500720020007300650065006E0020006900740020006200650066006F007200650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Look, I’ve got a bench covered in goo, a Goomy on\nthat bench, and then you standing right by it.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I need to figure out what happened here and how\nto keep it from happening again, and I don’t see<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nanyone else to ask.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 124
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Do you know who this Goomy belongs to, if it’s\nnot yours?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006F00200079006F00750020006B006E006F0077002000770068006F0020007400680069007300200047006F006F006D0079002000620065006C006F006E0067007300200074006F002C00200069006600200069007420190073000A006E006F007400200079006F007500720073003F001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No idea",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F002000690064006500610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Someone who isn’t me",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F006D0065006F006E0065002000770068006F002000690073006E201900740020006D00650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No comment",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00200063006F006D006D0065006E00740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I see...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020007300650065002E002E002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hm...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006D002E002E002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And what brings you by this particular bench\ntonight, if this isn’t your Goomy?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I wanted to pet the Goomy",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002000770061006E00740065006400200074006F0020007000650074002000740068006500200047006F006F006D00790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I just wanted to sit down...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006A007500730074002000770061006E00740065006400200074006F002000730069007400200064006F0077006E002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No comment",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00200063006F006D006D0065006E00740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I guess that’s fair...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002000670075006500730073002000740068006100742019007300200066006100690072002E002E002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmm...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006D006D002E002E002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Are you from around here? Maybe you can point\nme to someone else who might know this Goomy.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m only here on vacation",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D0020006F006E006C0079002000680065007200650020006F006E0020007600610063006100740069006F006E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No comment",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00200063006F006D006D0065006E00740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Is that so...?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900730020007400680061007400200073006F002E002E002E003F001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmmm...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006D006D006D002E002E002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’re SURE this Goomy isn’t your Pokémon?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F0075201900720065002000530055005200450020007400680069007300200047006F006F006D0079002000690073006E2019007400200079006F0075007200200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E003F001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It honestly isn’t, ma’am",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049007400200068006F006E006500730074006C0079002000690073006E20190074002C0020006D006120190061006D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I do not know this Goomy",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900200064006F0020006E006F00740020006B006E006F00770020007400680069007300200047006F006F006D00790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You know it’s not a big deal if it is your Goomy,\nright? I just need to get to the bottom of this.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gooomaaa!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047006F006F006F006D00610061006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I can’t help but notice this Goomy is real friendly\nwith you, considering it’s not yours...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "OK, how about this. If this really isn’t your Goomy,\nyou won’t mind showing me the Pokémon you’re<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nactually here with, will you?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "To be clear—I’m challenging you to a battle, kid.\nLet’s see your team up close!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 3160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You certainly put up a good fight. I’ll give you that.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 3172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00750020006300650072007400610069006E006C007900200070007500740020007500700020006100200067006F006F0064002000660069006700680074002E002000492019006C006C0020006700690076006500200079006F007500200074006800610074002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Right, then. NOW will you admit that this Goomy\nis actually yours?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 3292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00520069006700680074002C0020007400680065006E002E0020004E004F0057002000770069006C006C00200079006F0075002000610064006D00690074002000740068006100740020007400680069007300200047006F006F006D0079000A00690073002000610063007400750061006C006C007900200079006F007500720073003F001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Goomy! I told you not to wander off!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 3436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047006F006F006D007900210020004900200074006F006C006400200079006F00750020006E006F007400200074006F002000770061006E0064006500720020006F00660066002100100002011400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gooomaaa!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 3520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047006F006F006F006D00610061006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You got that bench all sticky, too...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 3540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007500200067006F007400200074006800610074002000620065006E0063006800200061006C006C00200073007400690063006B0079002C00200074006F006F002E002E002E00100002011400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "There! All cleaned up. Come on, Goomy—let’s\nhead home!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 3624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006500720065002100200041006C006C00200063006C00650061006E00650064002000750070002E00200043006F006D00650020006F006E002C00200047006F006F006D00792014006C0065007420190073000A006800650061006400200068006F006D0065002100100002011400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That, er...that wasn’t your Goomy after all, then.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 3744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800610074002C002000650072002E002E002E00740068006100740020007700610073006E2019007400200079006F0075007200200047006F006F006D007900200061006600740065007200200061006C006C002C0020007400680065006E002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m sorry, kid. There are so many wild Pokémon\naround Lumiose these days—I’m feeling the<U+0010><U+0001>븀\npressure to head off trouble when I see it.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 3856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 140
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let me share a tip with you to make up for all\nthe trouble.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nTo evolve Goomy into its final Evolution, you’ll\nneed to make use of rain!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 4136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 142
    },
    {
      "displayText": "With that, I’ll take my leave. Thanks for bearing\nwith me today, kid!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 4420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005700690074006800200074006800610074002C002000492019006C006C002000740061006B00650020006D00790020006C0065006100760065002E0020005400680061006E006B007300200066006F0072002000620065006100720069006E0067000A00770069007400680020006D006500200074006F006400610079002C0020006B006900640021001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    }
